  "subject": "A fourteen-year-old who letters the hymn numbers on the chalkboard in a Tainan Presbyterian church smudges a 3 into an 8 one Sunday, so half the congregation sings two different hymns at once.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Presbyterian church hymn, slow four-part congregational style. Pump organ playing full chords, mixed four-part choir with a clear female lead and firm male bass line, soft timpani on downbeats, upright piano doubling the hymn tune. Warm church-hall reverb, natural room acoustics. Mixed choir vocal, solemn clear delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 76 BPM, E-flat major. Earnest, gently humorous mood. No drum kit, no synthesizers, no autotune, no electric guitar, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n拜日早起，阮上早到\n粉筆一枝，黑板一塊\n聖詩的號碼，我來寫\n牧師講，字著寫予大\n[Pre-Chorus]\n三字號碼，一劃一劃\n手汗滴佇黑板邊\n[Chorus]\n三抑是八，咱攏愛唱\n主聽著的，是咱的聲\n毋是黑板頂的字\n是阮的喉嚨\n[Verse]\n風琴先生彈三百零三\n後排阿伯翻三百零八\n兩條聖詩，同時開喙\n牧師的目睭，笑甲瞇瞇\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共手汗擦佇褲底\n我低頭，等人來罵\n[Chorus]\n三抑是八，咱攏愛唱\n主聽著的，是咱的聲\n無論字寫甲偌歪\n嘛是阮的喉嚨\n[Verse]\n禮拜了，牧師共我講\n這禮拜的詩，上鬧熱\n兩條纏做一條，無人嫌\n風琴先生，笑甲歪腰\n[Bridge]\n後禮拜，我閣寫\n這擺字寫較大，嘛較清\n[Chorus]\n三抑是八，咱攏愛唱\n主聽著的，是咱的聲\n毋是黑板頂的字\n是阮全家伙的喉嚨\n[Outro]\n阿們，阿們\n三抑是八，攏是歌",
